    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d679">

                <pb facs="0791" n="671" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg671"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Spanish Chargé to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The Legation of Spain</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">New
                                York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-08-01"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 1,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary</hi>: I have the honor to inform your
                    excellency that the government of His Majesty has notified that of the Sultan of
                    Morocco that it is disposed to take part in the conference proposed by <pb
                        facs="0792" n="672" xml:id="pg672"/> him, provided it be previously informed
                    of the programme of the conference, as well as the date and the place in which
                    it is to be held.</p>
                <p>In thus complying with the instructions of my government I take advantage,
                    etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">L. Pastor.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
